---
// Section header that introduces the project stack — fills its own screen.
---

<section
  class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-5 py-[70px]"
  style="min-height:calc(100dvh - 53px);"
>
  <div class="font-script text-[24px]" style="transform:rotate(-3deg);">
    explore my work ↴
  </div>

  <h2
    data-reveal
    class="font-pixel leading-[0.92] my-[clamp(12px,3vh,28px)] uppercase"
    style="font-size:clamp(44px,8vw,104px);"
  >
    Featured<br />Works
  </h2>

  <div
    data-reveal
    class="inline-block border-[1.5px] border-ink px-4 py-2 max-w-[300px] text-[12px] font-mono shadow-hard-2 bg-paper"
    style="--reveal-delay:120ms;"
  >
    This is a showcase of what happens when curiosity drives the process.
  </div>
</section>
